  "description": "As a Ghost of Yotei fan, you can now bring your favorite games to life in your hands with the Sony PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Ghost of Yotei Gold Limited Edition. The DualSense controller has haptic feedback, so you can feel when you drive through a gravel pit in a racing game, for example. The controller also has dynamic trigger effects, which are triggers with resistance that adapt to the game you're playing. When you pull the string of a bow to shoot an arrow, you feel the tension build up on your fingers. In addition, a cable doesn't limit your freedom of movement with this wireless controller. You can also easily use the DualSense controller on a Windows PC, Mac, Android, or iOS phone. You need a USB-C cable for this.",
